    const val clinicalRule = "Clinical wording stays in English until a clinician who reads the language has reviewed it. A reference range, a dose, an observation label and a refusal sentence from a clinical contract are shown in English in every locale below, because a mistranslated instruction is a safety problem rather than a polish problem."
    const val fallback = "A key a locale does not carry is rendered in English, never blank and never as its own key name. A locale that carries only the shell shows an English hero banner and an English vetting console, and says so in the language dialog rather than letting the reader discover it."
    const val signLanguageName = "South African Sign Language"
