    val signLanguageMustHappen: List<Pair<String, String>> = listOf(
        "The booking will not complete without an interpreter" to "When the account records this requirement, a visit is not offered at a time no interpreter is available. It is offered at the next time one is, with the wait shown, because a slot booked without an interpreter is a visit that will fail on the doorstep.",
        "The nurse knows before she leaves" to "The dispatch note says the patient signs, that an interpreter is arranged, and how the interpreter will be present. It says nothing else about the patient’s hearing, because how much somebody hears is a clinical fact and the dispatch note is not a clinical record.",
