    val signLanguageNeverHappens: List<String> = listOf(
        "A family member is never used as the interpreter for a clinical conversation. Not a spouse, not an adult child, not a neighbour who signs a little. A person who is part of the story cannot be the channel it is told through, and a child interpreting a diagnosis for a parent is a harm the appointment caused.",
        "A Deaf patient is never written to in English and assumed to have understood. English is a second language for many Deaf South Africans and SASL is their first. A nod is not comprehension, and neither is a signature.",
